// What a chest holds the first time it is opened: table -> [(item, min, max, chance 0..1)].
// "village" fills chests found in village huts, "barrow" those underground in barrows,
// "sky_island" the chest at the middle of each bigger sky island.
// Chests you place yourself start empty.
// "rotting" is rolled for every foe that falls in a dungeon, "rotting_warden" for each floor's
// boss (game::delve): the only source of the dungeon materials. Chests on a dungeon floor:
// "dungeon_prize" (behind the last boss), "dungeon_treasure", "dungeon_puzzle", "dungeon_secret".
// quality: table -> odds of (plain, fine, masterwork, relic) for the weapons, tools, shields and
// armor it gives (traits.ron); tables not listed give plain ones.
(
    quality: {
        "barrow": (0.75, 0.22, 0.03, 0.0),
        "sky_island": (0.5, 0.35, 0.13, 0.02),
        "rotting": (0.65, 0.28, 0.07, 0.0),
        "rotting_warden": (0.0, 0.3, 0.6, 0.1),
        "dungeon_prize": (0.0, 0.1, 0.5, 0.4),
